Explanation of the main changes:

- We’ve changed the signature to `handleAfterOpen(popupRef)` so that, in v2, when the new `Overlay` calls your `afterOpen(overlayRef.current)`, you pick that up as `popupRef`.
- We fall back to `this.popup` when no `popupRef` is passed (the old v1 path).
- We branch inside on whether we have `.getInstance()` (v1) or `.getContentNode()` (v2) and extract the dropdown element accordingly.
- Everything else (height measurement, cascading to the user’s `afterOpen`) stays the same.

With this patch in place, your `<CascaderSelect popupProps={{ v2: true }} showSearch ... />` usage should no longer blow up at `getInstance` when running under the v2 overlay.
